lines+=['','HOLD means certification incomplete; it does not by itself justify regeneration or revoke user visual acceptance. No new generation, packing, calibration or public-output edits were performed.','', '## Evidence and method','', '[Complete coordinates, hashes, exclusions and intervals](measurements.json). [Idle frames](idle-contact.png), [light3 frames](light3-contact.png), [airRecover frames](airRecover-contact.png). All comparisons use the exact neutral/combat cells at native density. Grid renderings use nearest-neighbor enlargement, no geometry adjustment.','', 'H below is hair-crown to chin, not an inferred skull height; skull crown is hidden. T is collar-to-garment-hem chord. UA/FA and thigh/shin are projected joint chains under clothing. S is visible heel-to-toe projection. Shoulder span is approximate garment/joint-center width. Individual endpoint choices can change a result by several pixels; uncertainties are H±4, T±6, UA/FA±6, thigh/shin±8, S±4 and shoulders±6 px, on both candidate and reference. Intervals propagate this uncertainty conservatively. A point ratio inside ±6% is never automatically a pass. Far-side chains and oblique/hidden joints are excluded explicitly per frame.','', 'Baseline H/T/UA/FA/thigh/shin/S/shoulders (px):']
